WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.060
[ SPEAKING KOREAN ]

00:00:22.783 --> 00:00:24.574
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: WHAT IS
DIRECTING?

00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:26.473
WHAT DOES IT REALLY MEAN 
TO BE A DIRECTOR?

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.869
I'M A DIRECTOR MYSELF,
BUT I DON'T REALLY KNOW

00:00:28.869 --> 00:00:31.260
WHAT TO SAY WHEN I
GET ASKED THIS QUESTION.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.790
IT'S A LITTLE EMBARRASSING
TO ANSWER WITH A STRAIGHT FACE.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.440
A BIT CRINGY AS WELL.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.659
BUT MORE THAN ANYTHING
ELSE, IT'S DIFFICULT TO GIVE

00:00:37.659 --> 00:00:39.917
A SHORT AND CLEAR
ANSWER.

00:00:39.917 --> 00:00:44.729
[ SPEAKING KOREAN ]

00:00:54.205 --> 00:00:55.299
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: WHEN I
GET ASKED THIS QUESTION

00:00:55.299 --> 00:00:57.159
DURING AN INTERVIEW,
I JUST WANT TO GLOSS

00:00:57.159 --> 00:00:59.350
OVER THE ANSWER
OR RUN AWAY.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:01.229
BUT THIS TIME, I WAS THE
ONE TO ASK THIS

00:01:01.229 --> 00:01:04.399
QUESTION TO THE FIVE DIRECTORS
NOMINATED TONIGHT.

00:01:04.399 --> 00:01:06.400
[ SPEAKING KOREAN ]

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:14.570
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: THE 
QUESTION WAS,

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:15.720
IF YOU HAVE TO EXPLAIN TO A

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.984
RANDOM KID ON THE STREET WHAT
DIRECTING IS IN 20 SECONDS,

00:01:18.984 --> 00:01:20.275
WHAT WOULD YOU SAY?

00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:23.943
[ SPEAKING KOREAN ]

00:01:25.572 --> 00:01:28.140
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: THE FIVE
DIRECTORS ALL SENT THEIR REPLIES.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.751
THE REPLIES WERE SOMETHING
VERY PERSONAL.

00:03:00.888 --> 00:03:03.009
[ SPEAKING KOREAN ] 

00:03:05.208 --> 00:03:08.617
&gt;&gt; AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:03:10.764 --> 00:03:13.504
CHLOE ZHAO, "NOMADLAND."

00:03:13.504 --> 00:03:20.859
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:03:34.608 --> 00:03:36.969
OH, MAN.

00:03:36.969 --> 00:03:39.549
THANK YOU, THANK YOU
TO THE ACADEMY.

00:03:39.549 --> 00:03:42.260
THANK YOU TO MY BRILLIANT,
BRILLIANT NOMINEES,

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.639
FELLOW NOMINEES, 
THANK YOU.

00:03:44.639 --> 00:03:48.689
MY ENTIRE "NOMADLAND" 
COMPANY.

00:03:48.689 --> 00:03:52.400
WHAT A CRAZY ONCE IN A LIFETIME
JOURNEY WE WENT ON TOGETHER.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.400
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.092
I'M SO GRATEFUL TO YOU.

00:03:55.796 --> 00:04:00.709
I'VE BEEN THINKING A LOT
LATELY OF HOW I KEEP GOING WHEN

00:04:00.709 --> 00:04:02.840
THINGS GET HARD.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.340
AND I THINK IT GOES BACK TO

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.180
SOMETHING I LEARNED 
WHEN I WAS A KID.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:12.519
WHEN I WAS GROWING UP IN CHINA,
MY DAD AND I USED TO PLAY THIS GAME.

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:17.130
WE WOULD MEMORIZE CLASSIC
CHINESE POEMS AND TEXTS,

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:19.560
AND WE WOULD RECITE
IT TOGETHER AND TRY TO

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.030
FINISH EACH OTHER'S
SENTENCES.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:25.090
AND THERE WAS ONE THAT
I REMEMBER SO DEARLY

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:29.730
IT'S CALLED "THE THREE
CHARACTER CLASSICS."

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:32.920
AND THE FIRST PHRASE GOES --

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.100
[ SPEAKING CHINESE ]

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:41.540
PEOPLE AT BIRTH ARE
INHERENTLY GOOD.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.810
AND THOSE SIX LETTERS HAD SUCH A
GREAT IMPACT ON ME WHEN I WAS A KID.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:48.940
AND I STILL TRULY BELIEVE 
THEM TODAY.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:53.510
EVEN THOUGH SOMETIMES IT MAY
SEEM LIKE THE OPPOSITE IS TRUE.

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:58.730
BUT I HAVE ALWAYS FOUND GOODNESS
IN THE PEOPLE I MET.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.070
EVERYWHERE I WENT IN THE WORLD.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:06.250
SO THIS IS FOR ANYONE WHO HAS

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:11.140
THE FAITH AND THE COURAGE TO
HOLD ON TO THE GOODNESS IN THEMSELVES.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.650
AND TO HOLD ON TO THE GOODNESS
IN EACH OTHER.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:16.290
NO MATTER HOW DIFFICULT
IT IS TO DO THAT.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.890
AND THIS IS FOR YOU, YOU INSPIRE
ME TO KEEP GOING.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:20.890
THANK YOU.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:21.390
THANK YOU.

